{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inTheContainer","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Line","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4LineV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Holding","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV7HoldingV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"inTheContainer","externalID":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV14inTheContainerAC4LineVy_AC7HoldingVGvp","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"“In the X is a Y.” \/ “In the X are a Y and a Z.” — the answer to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"search","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/inTheContainer","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inTheContainer","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","text":"GameText","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4LineV","text":"Line","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Line"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","text":"GameText","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV7HoldingV","text":"Holding","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Holding"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It ships the same sentence as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/itemInContainer"},{"type":"text","text":" and is deliberately a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"second slot, because the two print at different moments and from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"different callers. This one answers a question the player asked, once,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"about everything in the container. That one is a paragraph of the room"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"description, printed per item, unasked, on every look — and any single"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one of them can be superseded by that item’s own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"firstSight"},{"type":"text","text":". A game"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that wants its room paragraphs terser than its search answers needs the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"two apart; merging them would be reuse bought with an authorial choice."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The verb agrees with the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"contents"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun\/list(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is what knows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their number: plural when there are several "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"or"}]},{"type":"text","text":" when the only one is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"itself plural. That rule used to live in this line’s body, where a game"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-voicing it would have had to re-derive it — and could have got it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wrong the way the engine did, printing “In the hamper is some scales.”"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/gametext\/inthecontainer"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText"]]},"references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameText/Noun/list(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gametext\/noun\/list(_:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun\/list(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"list","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","text":"GameText","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","text":"Noun","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","text":"GameText","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","text":"Noun","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"list(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Several nouns as one — “a sword, a lamp, and some scales” — carrying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the number the whole phrase has rather than the number any one of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them has."}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameText":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Every stock player-facing line the engine can say, as one overridable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value — so a game can speak in its own voice without touching behavior.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText","title":"GameText","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gametext","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GameText"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GameText"}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameText/inTheContainer":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/inTheContainer","abstract":[{"text":"“In the X is a Y.” \/ “In the X are a Y and a Z.” — the answer to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"search"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"inTheContainer","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gametext\/inthecontainer","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"inTheContainer","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Line","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4LineV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GameText"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV7HoldingV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Holding"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameText/Holding":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Holding"}],"role":"symbol","title":"GameText.Holding","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gametext\/holding","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Holding"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A thing and what holds it: what the player put down, and the box, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"te